  "body": "### Describe the feature you'd like to request\n\nI can only agree with @Meierschlumpf; such an integration would be great, maybe not today or tomorrow, but if there were the time and inclination to integrate it, that would be fantastic.\n\n\"Wazuh is a open source SIEM. It would be amazing if it was possible to have direct integration so we can see live updated data from Wazuh in Homarr. :) Unfortunately im not a developer so i can't make it myself, but i can contribute with it though. And this would possible bring new users also because wazuh people love to have a fancy dashaboard with \"everything\" :)\"\n\n### Additional information\n\nOriginally posted https://github.com/ajnart/homarr/issues/2073",
