      "body": "Personally, I can only speak for myself, what @Meierschlumpf has in mind might be something completely different, of course, since I\u2019m not a professional programmer and have only scratched the surface of Wazuh. That said, it would be great for me personally if Homarr\u2019s integrations included something like \"Wazuh Stats\", a feature where you could select and display various Wazuh graphs, such as alert summaries, Docker activity, or vulnerabilities. And the really cool thing would be having that right next to my calendar and system stats\u2014something highly customizable.\n\n<img width=\"2816\" height=\"1536\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/05b257a6-20ab-463c-9b5c-af1ca026674e\" />",
